    category: null
    properties[1]: scroll-target-group
    cssRule: "scroll-target-group: auto"
    responsive: false
    description: "* Scrollspy nav: native scroll-target-group + :target-current.\n * Fallback class .scrollspy-current set via IntersectionObserver in Lab recipe.\n * Prefer aria-current sync in script (visual alone is not exposed to AT)."
